<div id="modalBasculaFactor" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Configurar báscula" class="modal-overlay fc-dialog-overlay">
    <div class="modal-content-sap fc-dialog">
        <header class="fc-dialog-head"><div class="fc-dialog-icon"><i class="bi bi-speedometer2"></i></div><div><span>CONFIGURACIÓN LOCAL</span><h3>Báscula de Factor Crítico</h3><p>Configura la conexión de esta tableta a la báscula.</p></div><button class="fc-icon-button" type="button" onclick="cerrarModal('modalBasculaFactor')" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button></header>
        <div class="fc-dialog-body"><label>Dirección IP<input id="fcIpBascula" class="sap-input" type="text" placeholder="Ej. 192.168.1.10" /></label><label>Comando<input id="fcComandoBascula" class="sap-input" type="text" placeholder="P" /></label><div class="fc-dialog-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i><span>Esta configuración se comparte con Inyecciones en este dispositivo.</span></div></div>
        <footer class="modal-footer"><button class="tbtn" type="button" onclick="cerrarModal('modalBasculaFactor')">Cancelar</button><button class="tbtn primary" type="button" onclick="guardarConfiguracionBasculaFactor()">Guardar configuración</button></footer>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="modalConfirmarFactor" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Confirmar captura" class="modal-overlay fc-dialog-overlay">
    <div class="modal-content-sap fc-dialog fc-confirm-dialog">
        <header class="fc-dialog-head"><div class="fc-dialog-icon success"><i class="bi bi-clipboard2-check"></i></div><div><span>PASO 4</span><h3>Confirma la captura</h3><p>Revisa los pesos antes de continuar.</p></div><button class="fc-icon-button" type="button" onclick="cerrarModal('modalConfirmarFactor')" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button></header>
        <div class="fc-dialog-body"><div class="fc-confirm-grid"><div><span>Lote</span><strong id="fcConfirmLote">—</strong></div><div><span>Factor</span><strong id="fcConfirmFactor">—</strong></div><div class="wide"><span>Selección</span><strong id="fcConfirmSeleccion">—</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Entrada</span><strong id="fcConfirmEntrada">0.000 kg</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Salida</span><strong id="fcConfirmSalida">0.000 kg</strong></div></div><div class="fc-confirm-note"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i><span>Confirma que el lote, el factor y los pesos sean correctos.</span></div></div>
        <footer class="modal-footer"><button class="tbtn" type="button" onclick="cerrarModal('modalConfirmarFactor')">Volver a revisar</button><button id="fcBtnConfirmarGuardado" class="tbtn primary" type="button" onclick="confirmarGuardadoFactor()"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i> Confirmar captura</button></footer>
    </div>
</div>
